| `searchDepth` | `basic` | `basic` or `a"},{"id":"p11s7","text":"dvanced` (Tavily's `search_depth`). |"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"The key resolves once per search, so an empty `TAVILY_API_KEY` fails the request with `WEB_MISSING_C"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"REDENTIAL` rather than falling through to an unrelated credential."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## Tests"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Unit tests mock the HTTP layer; the smoke test runs a real Tavily search when `TAVILY_API_KEY` is se"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"it tests mock the HTTP layer; the smoke test runs a real Tavily search when `TAVILY_API_KEY` is set."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
